{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate the remnants of a fallen empire in an action roguelike where extraction meets base defense. Extract valuable loot, establish defenses against hostile fanatics, and unlock the gateway to a dimension of cosmic dread that defies comprehension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/79088db6ef8751efc0db5c5003e8b97a.poster.avif?t=1764396313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/79088db6ef8751efc0db5c5003e8b97a.webm?t=1764396313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859970/extras/79088db6ef8751efc0db5c5003e8b97a.mp4?t=1764396313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>RAID A FALLEN EMPIRE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every region of the empire has unique challenges, quests, and loot. Collect as much as you can and extract without dying to build your arsenal. No raid into a region is the same as the enemy adapts to each successful extraction you pull off. Countless combinations of weapons and abilities await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DEFEND YOUR BASE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of pirates, a legion of traitors, and an armada of cultists want you dead.\u00a0Craft a variety of defensive structures to hold off waves of enemies. Race the clock between each attack to recover and raid the enemy back before they come again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ENTER THE VEIL</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a gateway into a corrupted realm that is spewing abominations into our dimension. Delve deep, defeat the terrors within, uncover its secrets, 